,"x":1046,"y":1292,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"우리는","x":1129,"y":1291,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"정보를","x":1242,"y":1291,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"플래터상에","x":1354,"y":1288,"width":161,"height":35}]},{"text":"자기적으로 기록하여 저장하고 플래터의 자기 패턴을 감지하여 정보를 읽는다.","words":[{"text":"자기적으로","x":289,"y":1348,"width":153,"height":35},{"text":"기록하여","x":454,"y":1348,"width":111,"height":35},{"text":"저장하고","x":580,"y":1348,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"플래터의","x":706,"y":1348,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"자기","x":837,"y":1349,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"패턴을","x":911,"y":1350,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"감지하여","x":1015,"y":1350,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"정보를","x":1157,"y":1350,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"읽는다.","x":1268,"y":1348,"width":105,"height":35}]},{"text":"읽기-쓰기 헤드는 모든 플래터의 각 표면 바로 위에서 “움직인다”. 헤드는 모든 헤","words":[{"text":"읽기-쓰기","x":350,"y":1406,"width":138,"height":35},{"text":"헤드는","x":504,"y":1406,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":603,"y":1408,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"플래터의","x":674,"y":1405,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"각","x":808,"y":1407,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"표면","x":850,"y":1407,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"바로","x":926,"y":1408,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"위에서","x":1002,"y":1408,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"“움직인다”.","x":1110,"y":1408,"width":165,"height":35},{"text":"헤드는","x":1293,"y":1407,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":1408,"y":1407,"width":66,"height":32},{"text":"헤","x":1488,"y":1405,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"드를 한꺼번에 이동시거는 디스크 암(disk arm)에 부착되어 있다 플래터의 표면은 원","words":[{"text":"드를","x":290,"y":1465,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"한꺼번에","x":364,"y":1465,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"이동시거는","x":496,"y":1464,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"디스크","x":653,"y":1464,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"암(disk","x":756,"y":1464,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"arm)에","x":875,"y":1466,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"부착되어","x":994,"y":1466,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"있다","x":1139,"y":1466,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"플래터의","x":1225,"y":1465,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"표면은","x":1375,"y":1464,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"원","x":1488,"y":1464,"width":30,"height":34}]},{"text":"형인 트랙(track)으로 논리적으로 나누어져 있고, 이것은 다시 섹터(sector)로 나누어져","words":[{"text":"형인","x":290,"y":1523,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"트랙(track)으로","x":361,"y":1523,"width":217,"height":37},{"text":"논리적으로","x":589,"y":1522,"width":147,"height":35},{"text":"나누어져","x":749,"y":1522,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"있고,","x":884,"y":1524,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"이것은","x":966,"y":1524,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"다시","x":1072,"y":1524,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"섹터(sector)로","x":1148,"y":1523,"width":228,"height":37},{"text":"나누어져","x":1389,"y":1522,"width":126,"height":35}]},{"text":"있다. 동일한 암 위치에 있는 트랙의 집합은 하나의 실린더(cylinder)를 형성한다. 하나","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":291,"y":1581,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"동일한","x":370,"y":1581,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"암","x":472,"y":1581,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"위치에","x":512,"y":1581,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":613,"y":1581,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"트랙의","x":681,"y":1580,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"집합은","x":784,"y":1580,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"하나의","x":886,"y":1582,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"실린더(cylinder)를","x":992,"y":1582,"width":292,"height":40},{"text":"형성한다.","x":1298,"y":1581,"width":142,"height":35},{"text":"하나","x":1456,"y":1581,"width":64,"height":35}]},{"text":"의 디스크 드라이브에는 수천 개의 동심원 실린더가 존재할 수 있고, 각 트랙은 수백 개","words":[{"text":"의","x":290,"y":1639,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"디스크","x":333,"y":1639,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"드라이브에는","x":433,"y":1639,"width":176,"height":35},{"text":"수천","x":620,"y":1639,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"개의","x":692,"y":1639,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"동심원","x":763,"y":1639,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"실린더가","x":867,"y":1639,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"존재할","x":1002,"y":1640,"widt